# Vellum agent contract v1

- Treat `sources/imported/` as immutable source snapshots.
- Treat `design/ir/` and `ui/generated/` as tool-owned output.
- Put application behavior, state, and safe extensions in `src/` and
  `components/`.
- Never silently discard unsupported import properties. Preserve diagnostics
  and conversion losses with the imported snapshot.
- Use stable imported component identities; do not replace generated identities
  with names based on array position.
- Keep platform-specific work in `platforms/` and optional native extensions in
  `native/`.
- Run scenarios and visual captures after imports, reimports, or layout changes.
- This template contains no media or audio subsystem. Add optional capabilities
  explicitly rather than assuming they exist.
